{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2025-2799","published":"2025-12-12T11:09:55Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:22.244739436Z","upstream":["CVE-2019-10269"],"summary":"bwa security update","details":"BWA is a program for aligning sequencing reads against a large reference genome (e.g. human genome). It has two major components, one for read shorter than 150bp and the other for longer reads.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nBWA (aka Burrow-Wheeler Aligner) before 2019-01-23 has a stack-based buffer overflow in the bns_restore function in bntseq.c via a long sequence name in a .alt file.(CVE-2019-10269)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bwa","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/bwa&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["bwa-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.aarch64.rpm","bwa-debuginfo-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.aarch64.rpm","bwa-debugsource-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["bwa-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["bwa-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.x86_64.rpm","bwa-debuginfo-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.x86_64.rpm","bwa-debugsource-0.7.17-2.oe2203sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2025-2799.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2025-2799"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2019-10269"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"Critical"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H"}]}